strings |id, value|

bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_grid_area_item_bypasses_auto_track_implicit_gate_2026-11-27, 0, "grid_item_line_extents (layout_engine.spl) skips every item whose grid_area is set, so the auto-template gate (grid_auto_template_n reset when an item is placed past the explicit lines) never sees an item placed by grid-area. Such a grid takes the explicit-auto sizing path with the wrong column count instead of the implicit-column path."
    web_grid_area_item_bypasses_auto_track_implicit_gate_2026-11-27, 1, "Repro: grid-template-columns:auto 1fr, 200px; a 40x20 blue item, then a 20x20 blue item at grid-area:1 / 3 (implicit 3rd auto column). Chrome 159: k=1 40..79 220..239, k=4 160..319 880..959. Head (work/webrender-grid-auto-track-20261127): k=1 40..99, k=4 160..399. Base 3543da84e51 (block fallback): 40..79 / 160..319."
    web_grid_area_item_bypasses_auto_track_implicit_gate_2026-11-27, 2, "Minimal repro (body{margin:0}, .w{margin-left:40px;width:200px;height:30px;display:grid}, 400x300, blue runs on CSS row 10): <div class='w' style='grid-template-columns:auto 1fr'><div style='width:40px;height:20px;background:#00f'></div><div style='grid-area:1 / 3;width:20px;height:20px;background:#00f'></div></div>"

